WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.480
Well, tonight wraps up our first week

00:00:02.480 --> 00:00:04.660
here at the Largo Theater,

00:00:04.660 --> 00:00:08.820
wonderful comedy theater in Los Angeles

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:12.920
and we're so happy that we
could take over this space.

00:00:12.920 --> 00:00:15.550
I'm doing this in the safest way possible.

00:00:15.550 --> 00:00:19.690
We have just very few crew
members working around me.

00:00:19.690 --> 00:00:21.390
Everyone's wearing masks.

00:00:21.390 --> 00:00:24.170
Everyone is socially distanced.

00:00:24.170 --> 00:00:27.412
And everyone has been tested, yeah.

00:00:27.412 --> 00:00:29.440
As an added precaution it was my idea

00:00:29.440 --> 00:00:33.290
that all crew members be sterilized.

00:00:33.290 --> 00:00:35.460
I was told this was not necessary,

00:00:35.460 --> 00:00:38.350
but I really don't want them having kids.

00:00:38.350 --> 00:00:41.030
Anyway, moving on, the entire audience,

00:00:41.030 --> 00:00:42.850
as you can imagine, is empty,

00:00:42.850 --> 00:00:46.380
except for my trusty assistant, Sona,

00:00:46.380 --> 00:00:47.950
always by my side.

00:00:47.950 --> 00:00:49.940
Hey Sona, how's it going?

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:51.323
Hey Conan, it's good.

00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:54.310
Why are you so much further back

00:00:54.310 --> 00:00:55.370
than you were the other time?

00:00:55.370 --> 00:00:56.600
You're practically out in the lobby.

00:00:56.600 --> 00:00:58.305
Why are you back that way?

00:00:58.305 --> 00:01:01.440
I think if I want to leave

00:01:01.440 --> 00:01:03.430
to go do something or get something,

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:04.420
I thought it would be better

00:01:04.420 --> 00:01:07.760
if I was closer to this
door than that one.

00:01:07.760 --> 00:01:09.520
Why would you leave when
I'm shooting a show?

00:01:09.520 --> 00:01:10.593
This is exciting.

00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:13.110
Um, I don't know.

00:01:13.110 --> 00:01:16.766
I want food, maybe a sandwich,

00:01:16.766 --> 00:01:18.273
go get some ramen.

00:01:19.340 --> 00:01:21.883
You'd go get ramen while
I'm shooting a show?

00:01:22.980 --> 00:01:23.973
I mean, yeah.

00:01:26.085 --> 00:01:28.952
I figured I'd just slip out

00:01:28.952 --> 00:01:30.852
and you probably wouldn't even notice.

00:01:32.300 --> 00:01:34.940
How do you think the show's going so far?

00:01:34.940 --> 00:01:36.746
I think it's good.

00:01:36.746 --> 00:01:38.923
I was looking at my phone.

00:01:42.452 --> 00:01:45.060
(Sona laughing)

00:01:45.060 --> 00:01:47.210
Nice to have an audience.

00:01:47.210 --> 00:01:48.043
Thanks, Sona.

